EXACT TAIL FORMULAS USED (certified columns):
  3-D cube (Lambda4, Lambda4_osc, Lambda3):  T_R <= 4*pi*[ s0^(3-p)/(p-3) + 2a*s0^(2-p)/(p-2) + a^2*s0^(1-p)/(p-1) ],
        s0 = R + 1/2 - sqrt(3)/2, a = sqrt(3)/2;  p=4: 4*pi*[1/s0 + a/s0^2 + a^2/(3 s0^3)];
        p=3.5: 4*pi*[2/sqrt(s0) + (4a/3)/s0^1.5 + (2a^2/5)/s0^2.5].
  2-D cube (Lambda4_mean):                   T_R <= 2*pi*[ s0^(2-p)/(p-2) + a2*s0^(1-p)/(p-1) ],
        s0 = R + 1/2 - sqrt(2)/2, a2 = sqrt(2)/2;  p=4: 2*pi*[1/(2 s0^2) + a2/(3 s0^3)].
  Ball enclosure: same primitives with s0 = R -+ 2a (3-D) / R -+ 2a2 (2-D) and (s +- a)^2 / (s +- a).

